{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/0a589f26ab7d5582e6ebfc84c60cdcfb.webp?t=1754580762\" width=615 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/e425024b6854df3e04d06ee70761d689.poster.avif?t=1754580762\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/e425024b6854df3e04d06ee70761d689.webm?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/e425024b6854df3e04d06ee70761d689.mp4?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>SECTOR ZERO is a reverse horror first-person physics-based puzzle platformer inspired by classics like Portal, Half-Life, and Alien vs. Predator. The story is set in space, inside of a huge asteroid which is being mined for its resources by human colonists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/5553a018c95f24ad7c6094c7288711e9.webp?t=1754580762\" width=615 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/c59abb744893c5dffebdd5bf73f8ed33.poster.avif?t=1754580762\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/c59abb744893c5dffebdd5bf73f8ed33.webm?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/c59abb744893c5dffebdd5bf73f8ed33.mp4?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The miners were too greedy, dug too deep and, in the core of the asteroid, they discovered you - the Player - an alien hive mind entity called &quot;The Corruption,&quot; which was awoken from its slumber and is now angry. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/5d41c0523f342d2f8260423342e5f039.webp?t=1754580762\" width=615 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/bb4d0ba2104b62de80c66d11a0836d72.poster.avif?t=1754580762\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/bb4d0ba2104b62de80c66d11a0836d72.webm?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/bb4d0ba2104b62de80c66d11a0836d72.mp4?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are loads of lasers, turrets, and other security measures standing in your way. However, your one critical advantage is the ability to corrupt and control all human-made machinery. This can give you the upper hand in platforming sequences or when solving various physics-based puzzles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/73b26d9a64349452c18ae454eb490d91.webp?t=1754580762\" width=615 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/1ec1ee72cc47b6477951142825e3bebf.poster.avif?t=1754580762\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/1ec1ee72cc47b6477951142825e3bebf.webm?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/1ec1ee72cc47b6477951142825e3bebf.mp4?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a monster! Jump, climb and crawl through the environments! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver around lasers, hide from turrets and sneak around enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Posses human made technology and use it to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your surroundings by pushing, pulling and biting objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller &amp; Steam Deck supported!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2352050?t=1754580762","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2352050?t=1754580762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/e8ad88826bc2c394fe034c5e66281c8a5f08b266/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754580762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/e8ad88826bc2c394fe034c5e66281c8a5f08b266/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754580762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3034030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas