d, they discovered you - the Player - an alien hive mind entity called &quot;The Corruption,&quot; which was awoken from its slumber and is now angry. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/5d41c0523f342d2f8260423342e5f039.webp?t=1754580762\" width=615 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/bb4d0ba2104b62de80c66d11a0836d72.poster.avif?t=1754580762\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/bb4d0ba2104b62de80c66d11a0836d72.webm?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/bb4d0ba2104b62de80c66d11a0836d72.mp4?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are loads of lasers, turrets, and other security measures standing in your way. However, your one critical advantage is the ability to corrupt and control all human-made machinery. This can give you the upper hand in platforming sequences or when solving various physics-based puzzles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/73b26d9a64349452c18ae454eb490d91.webp?t=1754580762\" width=615 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/1ec1ee72cc47b6477951142825e3bebf.poster.avif?t=1754580762\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/1ec1ee72cc47b6477951142825e3bebf.webm?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/1ec1ee72cc47b6477951142825e3bebf.mp4?t=1754580762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a monster! Jump, climb and crawl through the environments! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver around lasers, hide from turrets and sneak around enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Posses human made technology and use it to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your surroundings by pushing, pulling and biting objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller &amp; Steam Deck supported!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ondrej Angelovic"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/4c5003449bb2c9c008dcd0e13831ddafd593602e/header.jpg?t=1754580762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 660 |  AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 | AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 |  AMD Radeon R9 380X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4gb VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</st